  //
  // Refinement notes for later edition:
  //  - This deliberately shows the "present but invalid" case (python3.14)
  //    alongside "present and valid" (python3.12) so the difference between
  //    silent skip and explained fault is visible in one place.
  //  - Optional external tools are shown as absent with an explicit statement of
  //    what capability is lost, so skipping is never silent.
  //  - The example plan is Windows-wizard-first but the same records are meant to
  //    drive cli/tui/web/desktop/mcp/ai-agent unchanged.

